 >>[2026-07-20] decide — domain modes CKB/genomic/UI/math share combinator→allele→locus→assay→expression mapping; packs are pulse+lens+metric+curriculum not new chrome.
 >>[2026-07-20] taste — usefulness for combinatoric and genomic work is population rarity + incremental assay, not richer single-file popovers.
 >>[2026-07-20 19:17] revise — operational-topography now owns neutral coordinates, E0/E1/E2 evidence grades, S0/S1/S2/S3 effects, and differential authority; the earlier G-grade and genomic mapping remains historical context, not current doctrine.
 >>[2026-07-20 19:18] decide — longitudinal craft uses variants, addresses, materializations, observations, episodes, and versioned idioms; biological language is an optional local translation.
 >>[2026-07-20 19:19] decide — garden pulses may select and measure, but edit-bearing ticks must consume exact parser-owned differential plans and cannot mutate fuzzy matches directly.
 >>[2026-07-20] decide — lyrical/compositional/semantic axes: ref forest walks (melody|assembly|meaning|novelty|byproduct); probes/expressions fuel pulses; beats precipitate TraceRecords (patterned vs novel; derivatives vs byproducts).
