 >>[2026-07-20] decide — editor-surface-physics.spw: prose kinds, brace format physics (string-safe indent reasons), selectability units, hot/warm/cold+sidecar caches, plugin thin-client behavior; SEORM material handling of source.
 >>[2026-07-20] decide — substrate-organelle-physics.spw: instantiate substrates; tune precipitate knobs; liminal spaces project beat memory with variable mutability; transform handles; ecological block anatomy; operators as portals vs suborganelles.
