#>wonder_spw_garden_geometry_1
?["Why does openDocument cost 747 ms on a 256-line theory file but about 28 ms on a 69-line pattern file and about 500 ms on a 1065-line plan?"]{
  #:depth #!computational // lens: indexing cost
  $^["open"]@here => $^["commits"]@here
  ~#hypothesis: "cost tracks annotation and wonder density, not line count, so a hover that shows analyze time would mislead on dense files."
  !probe{ "time ServerIndex.openDocument (packages/spw-lsp/src/server-index.ts) after one warm-up call on docs/theory/spw/onf.spw, .spw/patterns/surface-identity.spw and this plan's PLAN.md; then split the time between lineContexts and annotation scanning and correlate with annotation count per file." }
  $%[analyze.open_document_ms, file.annotation_count]
}
